  speakerName: "B\xE0 M\u1EADn"
  portrait: {fileID: 824597434760713125, guid: d9cd513cc127c82479931333a891b8db, type: 3}
  continuePrompt: "Nh\u1EA5n C \u0111\u1EC3 ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c"
  closePrompt: "Nh\u1EA5n C \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\xF3ng"
  lines:
  - english: I can read the names by the lake again. Hello, old friends.
    vietnamese: "B\xE0 l\u1EA1i \u0111\u1ECDc \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c nh\u1EEFng c\xE1i
      t\xEAn b\xEAn h\u1ED3 r\u1ED3i. 'Hello, old friends' \u2014 ch\xE0o nh\u1EEFng
      ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1EA1n c\u0169."
  - english: Thank you for listening, not just passing by.
    vietnamese: "C\u1EA3m \u01A1n ch\xE1u v\xEC \u0111\xE3 l\u1EAFng nghe, ch\u1EE9
      kh\xF4ng ch\u1EC9 \u0111i ngang qua."
